<h2 id="affiliate">The Skillshare affiliate program</h2>
<p>Separate from the teacher referral bonus, Skillshare runs an <a href="https://www.skillshare.com/en/affiliates">affiliate program</a> for bloggers, YouTubers and publishers, managed through an affiliate network. As of 2026 its key terms are:</p>
