<h2 id="bottom-line">Bottom line: can you make money on Skillshare?</h2>
<p>Yes, if you are willing to build a library of watchable classes in a niche Skillshare members love and actively grow a following. It is a poor fit if you want predictable income from day one or plan to publish one class and walk away. Treat it as one income stream among several, and explore more ideas on the <a href="/blog/">Better Side Hustles blog</a>.</p>
